  m_text: '<b>MASTER PATTERN SOLVER RECAP</b>

    - <b>Negative Numbers:</b> Below
    zero use a minus sign and decrease downward.

    - <b>Even Numbers:</b> End
    in 0, 2, 4, 6, 8 and split evenly into two equal parts.

    - <b>Square Numbers:</b>
    Form perfect square arrays (4 x 4 = 16) with identical rows and columns.

    -
    <b>Divisibility:</b> Factors fit evenly with 0 remainder. Any whole number ending
    in 0 divides cleanly by 10!'
